description	"Kyle Katarn 

A Force-sensitive mercenary who must choose his own path.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Red/Blue)
-- Saber/Blaster Defense (0)
-- Blaster Deflect (2)
-- 42% less Red/8% more Blue damage
-- 25% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage
- Thermal Grenades (2)
- Stun Baton (2)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (2)

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Slow Faller
- Dexterity (1)
- Force Focus (1)"